OL,3,GNEWSAKiller guilty after victim's cry
OL,4,Aheard on 999 call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA neighbour's 999 call captured a man's
OL,7,Fdesperate cries for help as he was
OL,8,Fattacked in a Birmingham flat, a court
OL,9,Fheard, as his killer was found guilty
OL,10,Fof murder.
OL,12,FMark Regan, 60, died in hospital two
OL,13,Fweeks after being attacked by Paul
OL,14,FHolloway, 39, in his room at the
OL,15,Fproperty in Tew Park Road.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
