OL,3,GNEWSAKiller guilty after victim's cry
OL,4,Aheard on 999 call
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth men had gone to the flat at around
OL,7,F1.45pm on 17 April. Ten minutes later,
OL,8,Fa neighbour called 999 to report seeing
OL,9,FHolloway viciously attacking Regan. A
OL,10,Fsecond neighbour also contacted police,
OL,11,Fwith the victim's cries for help
OL,12,Faudible in the background of the call.
OL,14,FHolloway was convicted on Monday after
OL,15,Fa trial at Birmingham Crown Court and
OL,16,Fwill be sentenced on 11 December.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
